# DLL debugging through the built-in host: the DLL is loaded and one export is
# called, so the symbol breakpoint set before `run` resolves when the module
# maps and is hit when the export runs.
# Run with: aidbg --exe tests/sample_dll.dll --script tests/dlltest.ajs
#
# Without an export the host stays alive by design (dllhost.c), so never wait
# on an unbounded `continue` after DllMain has been reached.
break sample_dll!SampleEntry
run SampleEntry
continue
continue
info
kill
